From 8c31eb9e73bf2163c3ea004c04654d6c9d131ba0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cizar-szymon <szymon@cs-lab.eu>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:07:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 0.136: the name of a building under the right button: held on
 a building of the boxes to choose one (until it goes up), held still 1 s on a
 building of the map (Viewport::handle_right_hold, Interface::draw_map_name;
 TypePress/TypeRelease of the right button); names of the buildings translated

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
